id: pm-gh1554
title: "GH-1554: resume bounded activity reads from a stable event window"
description: The October23 report shows activity limit truncation without a cursor or fixed-window recovery under concurrent writers. Reproduce current producer semantics and implement a stable bounded continuation or explicit fixed-window consistency recovery. Include the since-to-from flag recovery papercut.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: context-management,"gh:1554",sdk
created_at: "2026-10-23T07:33:56.767Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-24T16:16:46.993Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-24T16:16:45.535Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-24T16:16:45.535Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: A current temporary-tracker regression proves the omitted event set under concurrent writes; Continuation or fixed-window recovery is bounded and stable for timestamp ties; SDK CLI and MCP share the same completeness contract and since misuse points to from.
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "Bounded activity queries expose an opaque checked continuation cursor, stable first-page clock and normalized window; duplicate timestamp rows are recovered exactly once, changed matching content refuses, and CLI/MCP/contracts/completion share the public SDK behavior. Since-to-from recovery preserves intent and refuses conflicting bounds; generator discovery and Zsh completion regressions are covered."
expected_result: "Bounded resume fetches omitted activity rows through SDK, CLI and MCP without unbounded rereads or silent skips; complete discovery and safe option recovery remain consistent."
actual_result: Activity linked suite passes53tests and additional guidance/catalog/contract/completion suite passes76tests. Same pre-fix controls fail for all four projections. Full canonical suite passes11206tests with3platform skips at exact100/100/100/100coverage; final calendar presentation delta separately passes38tests and a full rerun is active. Full static and exact-head hosted checks/review remain merge gates. Real Zsh capture confirms19clean option arguments.
